@page "/attachments/{id:guid}"
@model CoupleOS.Api.Pages.Attachments.DownloadModel
@* No markup. The handler returns the file or a 404, and this page exists only
   to give that handler a route. A Razor page rather than a minimal API endpoint
   so it goes through the same SessionAuthenticationMiddleware as everything
   else — an endpoint mapped outside the page pipeline is exactly where a
   "temporarily" unauthenticated download would be introduced. *@
